# mktodo Implementation Plan

**Version:** 1.0  
**Created:** 2026-05-02  
**Status:** Active  
**Project:** mktodo - Markdown TODO Management Tool

## Project Overview

**Goal:** Build a Go-based CLI and TUI application for managing TODO items in markdown files within git repositories.

**Module:** `github.com/jvzantvoort/mktodo`

**Core Dependencies:**
- `github.com/spf13/viper` - Configuration management
- `github.com/spf13/cobra` - CLI framework
- `github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea` - TUI framework

**Key Principles:**
- Code quality: Pass `go vet` and `golangci-lint`
- Testing: Aim for 80%+ coverage
- Simplicity: Avoid unnecessary complexity
- UX consistency: Unix conventions, clear errors, accessible interface

## Project Structure

```
mktodo/
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       ├── ci.yml              # CI pipeline
│       ├── release.yml         # Release automation
│       └── lint.yml            # Linting checks
├── cmd/
│   ├── root.go                 # Root command setup
│   ├── add.go                  # Add TODO command
│   ├── remove.go               # Remove TODO command
│   ├── done.go                 # Mark done command
│   ├── list.go                 # List TODOs command
